          {
            "text": "Lane Beachley discovered surfing as a grommet growing up in Manly.",
            "start": 35.44,
            "end": 40.92
          },
          {
            "text": "And to say she talked to it is something of an understatement.",
            "start": 40.92,
            "end": 44.84
          },
          {
            "text": "Lane went on to win seven world championships, becoming the first woman to do so and the",
            "start": 44.84,
            "end": 50.12
          },
          {
            "text": "only surfer, male or female, to win six consecutive world titles.",
            "start": 50.12,
            "end": 56.28
          },
          {
            "text": "Lane's love of surfing was not the only thing driving her remarkable success.",
            "start": 56.28,
            "end": 61.88
          },
          {
            "text": "When Lane was a little girl, her dad Neil told her she was adopted.",
            "start": 61.88,
            "end": 66.6
          },
          {
            "text": "And from that moment, Lane questioned where she really belonged.",
            "start": 66.6,
            "end": 70.96
          },
          {
            "text": "She fought hard to prove to others and to herself that she was worthy of taking her place,",
            "start": 70.96,
            "end": 76.4
          },
          {
            "text": "developing a tough facade both on the water and off it, pushing through self-doubt,",
            "start": 76.4,
            "end": 81.84
          },
          {
            "text": "chronic fatigue and debilitating injuries to just keep winning.",
            "start": 81.84,
            "end": 87.12
          },
          {
            "text": "But at this stage of her life, Lane has found how to slow down and really enjoy her place",
            "start": 87.12,
            "end": 92.28
          },
          {
            "text": "in the world.",
            "start": 92.28,
            "end": 93.28
          },
          {
            "text": "Hi Lane.",
            "start": 93.28,
            "end": 94.28
          },
          {
            "text": "Hello Sarah.",
            "start": 94.28,
            "end": 95.44
          },
          {
            "text": "Can you remember the first wave you ever caught all the way to the beach?",
            "start": 95.44,
            "end": 102.64
          },
          {
            "text": "My earliest memories of surfing actually started on the harbourside at Manly.",
            "start": 102.64,
            "end": 108.76
          },
          {
            "text": "So my dad put me on a foamy when I was around three or four years of age and I stood up",
            "start": 108.76,
            "end": 114.8
          },
          {
            "text": "on it and waited for the fairies to come in to create that boatwake.",
            "start": 114.8,
            "end": 119.12
          },
          {
            "text": "We all owned a...",
            "start": 119.12,
            "end": 119.96
          }
